@startuml RF40_Sequencia
title RF40 — Criar o próprio avatar 3D a partir de fotos (aba "Meu Avatar 3D") e usá-lo no manequim\nDiagrama de sequência — gerar a prévia no navegador, salvar com consentimento, ajustar e excluir
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor Pessoa as U
participant "avatar/page.tsx\n→ my-avatar.tsx" as FE
participant "lib/avatar3d\npipeline · detect · quality\nsex-detect · atlas · model" as PIPE
participant "public/mediapipe\n(Face Landmarker, hair_segmenter,\nselfie_multiclass, face-api)" as MP
participant "Avatar3dController" as AC
participant "Avatar3dService" as AS
participant "AiEngine (RF24)\nCONTENT_MODERATOR" as AI
participant "MediaStoragePort\n(local / S3)" as ST
participant "Audit" as AU
database "MySQL\nuser_avatars_3d" as DB

U -> FE: abre /avatar
FE -> AC: GET /api/me/avatar3d
AC -> AS: get(user)
AS -> DB: findByUserId(user)
AS --> FE: 200 {exists: false} | {exists: true, model, adjust, textureUrl,\nphotos, warnings, publicOnRunway, textureModeration, consentAt}

== Gerar a prévia (só no navegador) ==
FE -> FE: carrega a foto de perfil (ou a pessoa envia outra)
U -> FE: Gerar prévia
FE -> PIPE: analyzePhoto(foto, "front")
PIPE -> PIPE: loadOriented (EXIF, até 1600 px)
PIPE -> MP: detectFace (478 pontos) · headMasks (cabelo, classes)\n· detectSex (corpo base)
PIPE -> PIPE: fitView (pose) · faceStats · sampleSkin · occlusion\n→ checkPhoto → Issue[] (block | warn)
alt issue "block"
  PIPE --> FE: AnalyzedPhoto com o motivo
  FE --> U: pede outra foto e explica (CA02)
else aceita
  FE -> PIPE: buildAvatar([foto], {sex, profileSex})
  PIPE --> FE: {model (v1, shape 468×3, skin, sex, hair, warnings), atlas}
  FE --> U: prévia girável (AvatarViewer), corpo base, avisos
end

== Salvar com consentimento ==
U -> FE: marca o consentimento e toca Salvar avatar
FE -> PIPE: atlasBlob(atlas) → JPEG
FE -> AC: POST /api/me/avatar3d (multipart: meta {model, adjust,\nphotos: 1, warnings, consent, publicOnRunway} + texture)
alt meta ilegível
  AC --> FE: 400 MODELO_INVALIDO
else
  AC -> AS: save(user, SaveCommand, bytes)
  alt consent != true
    AS --> FE: 400 CONSENTIMENTO_OBRIGATORIO
  else modelo ou textura inválidos
    AS --> FE: 400 MODELO_INVALIDO · TEXTURA_INVALIDA\n(textura quadrada 256–2048 px, ≤ 4 MB)
  else ok
    AS -> ST: put(restricted/users/{id}/avatar3d/face-{ts}.jpg, image/jpeg)
    opt publicOnRunway (padrão: true)
      AS -> AI: text(TextCall CONTENT_MODERATOR, textura reduzida a 512 px)
      AI --> AS: approved true | false | sem veredito
      AS -> AS: APPROVED | REJECTED_POLICY | PENDING
    end
    AS -> DB: save(UserAvatar3d): model_json, adjust_json, texture_key,\nphotos_count, warnings_json, consent_at, texture_moderation
    AS -> ST: delete(textura anterior)
    AS -> AU: log AVATAR3D_SALVO
    AS --> FE: 200 view(avatar)
  end
end

== Ajustar ==
U -> FE: ajustes finos, corpo base, "Público" ou corpo inteiro (BodyEditor)
FE -> AC: PATCH /api/me/avatar3d {adjust | publicOnRunway | sex | body}
AC -> AS: update(user, SettingsCommand)
alt sem avatar
  AS --> FE: 404
else corpo fora das faixas (validateBody)
  AS --> FE: 400 CORPO_INVALIDO
else ok
  AS -> AS: clampAdjust (faixas pequenas)
  opt passou a público e a textura está PENDING
    AS -> ST: get(textureKey)
    AS -> AI: moderateTexture
  end
  opt body
    AS -> AU: log AVATAR3D_CORPO
  end
  AS -> DB: save(UserAvatar3d)
  AS --> FE: 200 view(avatar)
end

== Excluir ==
U -> FE: Excluir avatar (confirmação)
FE -> AC: DELETE /api/me/avatar3d
AC -> AS: delete(user)
AS -> ST: delete(textureKey)
AS -> DB: delete(UserAvatar3d)
AS -> AU: log AVATAR3D_EXCLUIDO
AC --> FE: 204
note over AS, DB: Na exclusão definitiva da conta, AccountService.purgeScheduledDeletions\nchama deleteAllFor(userId): some o modelo e a textura (CA09)
@enduml
